# Résumé project: what a helper may see.
# Allow-list: everything at the root is ignored, then only the lines with "!" come back.
# A new folder stays private until someone adds a "!" line for it here.
# Check before the first commit: sh 005_SCRIPTS/002_preview_share.sh

/*

# --- shared: these folders and files, nothing else ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/PROJECT_INDEX.md
!/000_GITHUB_BACKUP/
!/000_PROJECT_HISTORY/
!/001_FINAL_RESUMES/
!/002_STRATEGIC_PITCH/
!/003_INTERVIEW_PREP/
!/004_DATA_REFERENCES/
!/005_SCRIPTS/
!/006_TESTS/

# --- never shared, even inside a shared folder ---
*_v[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*_[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]__*
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
~$*
